"""Byte-oriented regular expressions for directory entry filters.

The interface uses ASCII character classes by default, permits explicitly
Unicode-aware scopes, and supports set operations inside character classes.
A small syntax translator makes these rules available through Python's regular
expression matcher without relying on an external regex package.
